{
  "id": "6aeb0058a0251626b548e163",
  "title": "平均値の法則",
  "created": 1793785946,
  "updated": 1793785978,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aeb0058a0251626b548e163",
      "text": "平均値の法則",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785946
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3bf",
      "text": "[道は開ける]の言葉だったはず[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785978
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3c0",
      "text": "\tほとんど起こらないことは起こらないので心配しなくてもいい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785946
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3c1",
      "text": "\t例",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785946
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3c2",
      "text": "\t\t雷に打たれて死んだらどうしよう！",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785946
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3c3",
      "text": "\t\t飛行機？事故るかもしれないじゃないか！！絶対乗りたくない！！",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785946
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3c4",
      "text": "\t「記録を調べてみよう」とある",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785955
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeb00590000000000a8d3c5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793785946,
      "updated": 1793785976
    }
  ]
}